Let $g:[0,\infty) \to [0, \infty)$ be nondecreasing with $g(x) \to \infty$. For $A \subset A' \subset \mathbb{Z}^d$, 
 define the {\it $g$-filtered lower Banach density}  by
    \begin{equation}
    \delta^g(A, A') = \liminf_{|S \cap A'|/ (g(\Vol(S))  \log \Vol(S) \to \infty}   \frac{|S \cap A \cap A'|}{|S \cap A'|}.\label{eq:banachdimd}
\end{equation}
where $S$ runs through all axis-parallel rectangles in $\mathbb{Z}^d$.

